WEBVTT

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:02.363
We could orient ourselves
toward a more just society,

00:06:02.397 --> 00:06:03.930
and on our way there,

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:07.530
we can't mystify practical
policy solutions.

00:06:08.897 --> 00:06:10.230
Myth three:

00:06:12.297 --> 00:06:16.030
If you believe that when all
the grandmas in Mississippi die

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.997
that racism is going to go with them,

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:20.763
you are in for a big disappointment.

00:06:21.663 --> 00:06:23.297
We like to think that young people

00:06:23.297 --> 00:06:26.597
are going to do the hard work
of eradicating racism,

00:06:26.597 --> 00:06:29.030
but there are some things
that we should note.